### Create a new report
POST http://localhost:3000/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "make": "toyota",
    "model": "corolla",
    "year": 1984,
    "mileage": 100000,
    "lng": 0,
    "lat": 0,
    "price": 500000,
    "approved": false

}

### Approve a report
PATCH http://localhost:3000/reports/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "approved": true
}

### Get the estimate for an existing vehicule
GET http://localhost:3000/reports?make=toyota&model=corolla&lng=0&lat=0&mileage=10000&year=1980
